    LLM: 'Match suit or number when possible; save Whot and special cards for when you have no match or to attack.\n\nKeep 2s and 5s to defend against Pick Two and Pick Three; play them when opponents hold few cards to slow them.\n\nUse Whot to demand a suit you hold or one an opponent likely lacks; play high-value cards first to minimise penalty if you do not win.',
